pan>-structures)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ElemEmb}_L\">\\(\\operatorname{ElemEmb}_L\\)</span> (elementary-embedding class, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"16340c2187670288\" href=\"?note=16340c2187670288\" title=\"17-df-elementary-embedding\">17-df-elementary-embedding</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Amalgamable}_L\">\\(\\operatorname{Amalgamable}_L\\)</span> (elementary-amalgamation predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"f14193aff07acd49\" href=\"?note=f14193aff07acd49\" title=\"17-df-elementary-amalgamation\">17-df-elementary-amalgamation</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f_1,f_2\">\\(f_1,f_2\\)</span> (maps with common source <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak A\">\\(\\mathfrak A\\)</span>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Bigl(\nf_1\\in\\operatorname{ElemEmb}_L(\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B_1)\n\\land\nf_2\\in\\operatorname{ElemEmb}_L(\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B_2)\n\\Bigr)\n\\to\n\\operatorname{Amalgamable}_L\n(\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B_1,\\mathfrak B_2;f_1,f_2).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Bigl(\nf_1\\in\\operatorname{ElemEmb}_L(\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B_1)\n\\land\nf_2\\in\\operatorname{ElemEmb}_L(\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B_2)\n\\Bigr)\n\\to\n\\operatorname{Amalgamable}_L\n(\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B_1,\\mathfrak B_2;f_1,f_2).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Elementary embeddings can be amalgamated by compactness; the common-source orientation is the one fixed in <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"f14193aff07acd49\" href=\"?note=f14193aff07acd49\" title=\"17-df-elementary-amalgamation\">17-df-elementary-amalgamation</a>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text"